理由：趋势下跌+RSI超买+缩量，但价格居中，严格风控下博短线回调。', '{"regime": "trending", "score": 0.677, "details": {"adx": {"value": 36.68, "score": 1.0}, "vol_ratio": {"value": 0.705, "score": 0.303}, "deviation": {"value": 0.0161, "score": 0.403}, "atr_change": {"value": 0.196, "score": 0.827}}, "btc_price": 79717.8, "btc_change_24h": -1.72, "funding_rate": 0, "trend_direction": "down", "fear_greed": 45, "regime_label": "趋势"}', '2026-05-08 02:03:29');
