【信心】高

**理由：** 价格位于宽幅区间中部，ADX仅11.1，盈亏比极差，无明确交易信号。', '{"regime": "ranging", "score": 0.204, "details": {"adx": {"value": 11.09, "score": 0.148}, "vol_ratio": {"value": 0.921, "score": 0.447}, "deviation": {"value": 0.0063, "score": 0.158}, "atr_change": {"value": -0.23, "score": 0.117}}, "btc_price": 80830.6, "btc_change_24h": -2.04, "funding_rate": 0, "trend_direction": "down", "fear_greed": 35, "regime_label": "震荡"}', '2026-05-07 12:02:49');
